        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to the Cathedral. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Duthorian Rall|r gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Gazin Tenorm|r lies wounded by the altar of the same hall. Keep the symbol: you need it on |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Henze Faulk|r. If you lose it, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Duthorian Rall|r gives you another (The |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r)." },
