        { "text", text = "Feedback: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Alathea|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 20 in Darnassus, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Alathea|r, on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon beside |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tyrande Whisperwind|r, hands you a letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Laurena|r in Stormwind." },
