        { "text", text = "Starshards: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Maxan Anvol|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10 in Dun Morogh, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Maxan Anvol|r, the priest trainer inside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, hands you Returning Home, a letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Alathea|r in Darnassus." },
