        { "text", text = "Learn the flight path from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Caylais Moonfeather|r where you land. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Laird|r's fish stall is just north of her, by the docks.\nThe boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street." },
