        { "text", text = "Contingency Plan: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Mims|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 20, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Mims|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r teaches Contingency Plan with a quest she gives and takes back at once. Contingency Plan wards a friend for 30 seconds: if they drop below 35% health, they get a shield and a heal over time at once (it stacks with Renew and Power Word: Shield). 5-minute cooldown." },
