        { "text", text = "Desperate Prayer: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10, go to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r, in Ironforge's |cOXP_PICK_Mystic Ward|r (north-west of the city): he gives Desperate Prayer and takes it back at once. No letter needed. Desperate Prayer heals you instantly, costs no mana and has a long cooldown: keep it for emergencies." },
