      { only = "Priest", when = { { "onquest", quests = { 5637 } } },
        { "text", text = "Desperate Prayer: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Maxan Anvol|r's letter" },
        { "text", text = "Follow the road up from Kharanos into Ironforge and west to the |cOXP_PICK_Mystic Ward|r: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r takes the letter and teaches Desperate Prayer. The letter tells you to head to Stormwind, but the one who wants you is Rohan in Ironforge." },
