        { "text", text = "Confounding Flash: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Laurena|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10 in Stormwind, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Laurena|r at the altar of the Cathedral of Light hands you a Confounding Flash letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Mims|r in Ironforge (the Deeprun Tram from the |cOXP_PICK_Dwarven District|r)." },
