        { "text", text = "At 10 in Darnassus, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Alathea|r, on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon beside |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tyrande Whisperwind|r, hands you a Desperate Prayer letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in Ironforge." },
