        { "text", text = "A Human priest in Teldrassil at 10: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Laurna Morninglight|r, in the building at the north edge of Dolanaar, hands you a letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priestess Laurena|r in Stormwind." },
