        { "text", text = "At 10, go to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Priestess Alathea|r on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon, at the south end of Darnassus: take the ramp up from the temple floor; she stands beside |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tyrande Whisperwind|r. Stars of Elune is given and taken back at once and teaches Starshards. No letter needed. Forever made Starshards hit much harder, on a 30-second cooldown." },
