        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Narm Faulk|r lies dead in Dun Morogh, not Loch Modan: east past Kharanos, north-east of Ironband's compound, on the smallest of three little hills between Helm's Bed Lake and the |cOXP_PICK_Dark Iron|r camp. Target his body and use the |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r to raise him, then speak to him. If another paladin just raised him, his body is back within about three minutes." },
