        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dink|r teaches mages in Ironforge's |cOXP_PICK_Mystic Ward|r. Take the Deeprun Tram from |cOXP_PICK_Tinker Town|r to Stormwind afterwards." },
