        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Hulfdan Blackbeard|r is in the house with a shady dealer outside, in the |cOXP_PICK_Forlorn Cavern|r, down the stairs. Then fly or take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind." },
