        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Renzik \"The Shiv\"|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Renzik \"The Shiv\"|r stands upstairs in the SI:7 building in |cOXP_PICK_Old Town|r, behind the rogue trainers. Before you leave: if you lack Pick Lock, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Lord Tony Romano|r in the SI:7 building teaches it; Lockpicking is the test of the next quest." },
