      {
        { "text", text = "The northern Blackwood camp" },
        { "text", text = "The furbolg camp south of the Cliffspring River keeps its Nut, Fruit and Grain Stores by the bonfires. With a sample of each and the |cOXP_LOOT_Filled Cleansing Bowl|r in your bags (the |cOXP_LOOT_Empty Cleansing Bowl|r is filled at the |cOXP_PICK_Auberdine Moonwell|r), use the bowl by the bonfire closest to the river: it summons Xabraxxis, the satyr corruptor, and the |cOXP_LOOT_Talisman of Corruption|r lies in his Demon Bag." },
        { "goto", x = 51.83, y = 33.5, zone = "1439" },
