        { "text", text = "At 25 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Zardeth of the Black Claw|r, in the cellar of the |cOXP_PICK_Slaughtered Lamb|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Mage Quarter|r (beside the warlock trainers), wants two ingredients for a brew. Do it when your leveling takes you to Duskwood and the Wetlands." },
