        { "text", text = "The Dor'Danil Barrow Den: kill these as you meet them" },
        { "text", text = "The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song.\nRusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel.\nCareful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together." },
