      { only = "Scourge Warlock",
        { "text", text = "In Search of Menara Voidrender (Undercity)" },
        { "text", text = "At 31 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kaal Soulreaper|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Magic Quarter|r sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r in Ratchet; the zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar. Buy a |cOXP_LOOT_Robes of Arcana|r and a |cOXP_LOOT_Gold Bar|r first (next steps) to save a trip." },
