        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kinelory|r's errand" },
        { "text", text = "Stay with |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kinelory|r while she sneaks into Go'Shek Farm and back; Horde orcs jump you on the way.\nCareful: Orcs that drop to low health run away. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kinelory|r follows them and can pull more mobs, so kill or slow runners fast." },
