        { "text", text = "Alone, you skip Nesingwary's three elite hunts: take their experience from the Skullsplitter trolls of Zul'Mamwe instead, just east of the mine, so every kill also counts for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kebok|r's tusks. Or, with a group, run the Uldaman dungeon instead." },
