      { only = "Druid",
        { "text", text = "Gorishi Stings and |cOXP_LOOT_Bloodcap|r" },
        { "text", text = "Eight of each. The Gorishi Wasps and Stingers (level 51-52) in and around the Slithering Scar, the hive in the south-west of the crater, drop a sting about one kill in seven; the wasps share spawn points with the other bugs, so kill whatever stands near you to make room for more wasps (respawn five minutes). The bugs' Silithid Pox makes you take more physical damage for 30 minutes; Workers call for help when hurt. The Bloodpetal Sprouts grow all over the crater (around Marshal's Refuge and the western half): open them, about every other one gives a |cOXP_LOOT_Bloodcap|r, back in three to five minutes." },
