        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r" },
        { "text", text = "Fly to Talrendis Point (Alliance) or Valormok (Horde). |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r camps below his master's tower, a short way east of Valormok: from the fork of Azshara's main road at the Ruins of Eldarath, head straight north to the cliffs. Get off your mount before he teleports you up, or the teleport may not take you. A trail with no enemies climbs to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Xylem|r at the top of the tower; an attendant at the top sends you back down, as often as you like." },
